{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 156,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.93421936035156,
        186.8113250732422,
        85.31422424316406
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41439819335938,
        107.56733703613281,
        512.3355712890625,
        120.48133850097656
      ],
      "text": "19.\t Either a tuberculin skin test (TST) or interferon-gamma release assays (IGRAs)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        108.41439819335938,
        123.06733703613281,
        295.5134582519531,
        135.98133850097656
      ],
      "text": "can be used to test for TB infection.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25689697265625,
        147.104248046875,
        397.4571228027344,
        159.98524475097656
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low certainty of the evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.62342834472656,
        134.13809204101562,
        194.5374298095703
      ],
      "text": "Justification",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.47332763671875,
        526.9635620117188,
        218.6183319091797
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review has informed the comparison of the predictive performance of IGRAs and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        220.97332763671875,
        526.6972045898438,
        234.1183319091797
      ],
      "text": "the TST for identifying incident active TB in countries with a TB incidence of more than 100 per",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.995048522949219,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        236.47332763671875,
        526.994384765625,
        249.6183319091797
      ],
      "text": "100 000 population  . Only studies in which the TST was compared with IGRAs in the same  (12)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        251.97332763671875,
        526.9481201171875,
        265.11834716796875
      ],
      "text": "population (i.e. “head-to-head” studies) were included. Relative risk ratios for TB for people",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        267.47332763671875,
        519.4283447265625,
        280.61834716796875
      ],
      "text": "who tested positive and those who tested negative with the TST and IGRAs were estimated.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.477294921875,
        526.964599609375,
        304.622314453125
      ],
      "text": "Five prospective cohort studies were identified, with a total of 7769 participants. The pooled",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        306.977294921875,
        527.01416015625,
        320.122314453125
      ],
      "text": "risk ratio estimate for the TST was 1.49 (95% CI: 0.79–2.80), and for IGRAs was 2.03 (95% CI:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        322.477294921875,
        526.9139404296875,
        335.622314453125
      ],
      "text": "1.18–3.50). Although the estimate for IGRAs was slightly higher than that for the TST, the 95%",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992297172546387,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.977294921875,
        437.9202880859375,
        351.122314453125
      ],
      "text": "CIs for the estimates for the TST and IGRAs overlapped and were imprecise.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        361.981201171875,
        526.969970703125,
        375.126220703125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG concluded that the comparison of the TST and IGRAs in the same population does",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        377.481201171875,
        526.9149780273438,
        390.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "not provide strong evidence that one test should be preferred over the other for predicting",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        392.981201171875,
        526.964599609375,
        406.126220703125
      ],
      "text": "progression to active TB disease. The TST may require significantly fewer resources than IGRAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        408.481201171875,
        526.9540405273438,
        421.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "and may be more familiar to practitioners in resource-limited settings; however, recurrent",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        423.981201171875,
        527.0194091796875,
        437.126220703125
      ],
      "text": "global shortages and stock-outs of the TST reduce prospects for the scale-up of this test and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        439.481201171875,
        526.9261474609375,
        452.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "for the programmatic management of TPT. The GDG also noted that equity and access could",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        454.981201171875,
        527.1433715820312,
        468.126220703125
      ],
      "text": "affect the choice and type of test used. The preferences of people to be tested and programmes",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.95892333984375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        470.481201171875,
        527.1506958007812,
        483.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "depend on several factors, such as the requirement for an adequately equipped laboratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        485.981201171875,
        527.2011108398438,
        499.126220703125
      ],
      "text": "(e.g. for IGRAs) and possible additional costs for people being tested (e.g. for travel) and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.481201171875,
        526.9540405273438,
        514.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "programmes (e.g. for infrastructure and testing). The GDG strongly recommended the two",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        516.981201171875,
        527.2396240234375,
        530.126220703125
      ],
      "text": "tests as equivalent options, with relatively similar advantages and disadvantages. The GDG",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.481201171875,
        526.9483032226562,
        545.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "stressed that the global shortage of the TST should be addressed urgently, and called for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        547.981201171875,
        526.9656982421875,
        561.126220703125
      ],
      "text": "more investment into research on novel tests for TB infection with better predictive value. The",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        563.481201171875,
        526.958984375,
        576.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "GDG cautioned that imperfect performance of these tests can lead to false negative results,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.981201171875,
        526.8236083984375,
        592.126220703125
      ],
      "text": "particularly in young children and immunocompromised individuals such as PLHIV with low CD4",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.946218490600586,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.481201171875,
        526.81982421875,
        607.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "counts. The GDG noted the importance of the tests to identify recent conversion from negative",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977426528930664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        609.981201171875,
        526.9810791015625,
        623.126220703125
      ],
      "text": "to positive, particularly among contacts of people with pulmonary TB, which is good practice",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        625.481201171875,
        526.9481811523438,
        638.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "when initiating TPT. Nevertheless, recent studies among health care workers in the USA tested",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992047309875488,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        640.981201171875,
        527.2608642578125,
        654.126220703125
      ],
      "text": "serially for TB infection showed that conversions from negative to positive and reversions from",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.988744735717773,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        656.481201171875,
        526.9586791992188,
        669.626220703125
      ],
      "text": "positive to negative are more commonly identified with IGRAs than with the TST  . Thus,  (13)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.981201171875,
        490.2659912109375,
        685.126220703125
      ],
      "text": "clinical judgement must still be used to interpret the results of serial TB infection tests.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        695.9852294921875,
        527.0252075195312,
        709.1302490234375
      ],
      "text": "The evidence reviewed and the recommendations given apply only to the use of the two",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        711.4852294921875,
        428.26702880859375,
        724.6302490234375
      ],
      "text": "commercially available IGRAs (QuantiFERON-TB Gold In-Tube and T-Spot.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "140 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}